        "message": "This adapter hides (db as object).read from SQL analysis (receiver or this). Call the executor on the SQL text (`(db as object).read(sql)`). `run((db as object).read, account)` is not a judged rewrite: analysis does not follow an executor passed as a value. Write the direct call explicitly. Analysis cannot check SQL that only reaches the executor through this adapter.",
